<%!
    from datetime import datetime, timedelta
    from pylons.i18n import ungettext
    from r2.models import Email
    from r2.lib import promote
    from r2.lib.template_helpers import get_domain
 %>
<%
    edit_url =  promote.promo_edit_url(thing.link)
    site = g.site_name or g.domain
 %>

%if thing.kind == Email.Kind.NEW_PROMO:
This email confirms that we've received your ad on ${site}. It has no campaigns
yet: to add one, visit the following link, choose the dates, budget and where it
should show, and click "save":

   ${edit_url}

Then pay for the campaign with the "pay" button in the campaign list. We review
ads once they're paid for, and an ad has to be approved before it can go live,
so please allow at least one business day before the campaign's start date. If
your ad isn't approved, the payment is refunded.

If you have any questions about advertising on ${site}, just reply to this
email.

%elif thing.kind == Email.Kind.BID_PROMO:
This email confirms your payment of ${thing.printable_total_budget} for an ad
on ${site}. Please keep it as your receipt.

Your ad will be reviewed before it goes live. If it isn't approved, the payment
is refunded. If you change the campaign's budget before it starts, this payment
is refunded and you pay the new amount instead.

You can review or change your ad until
${(thing.start_date - timedelta(1)).strftime("%Y-%m-%d")} here:

    ${edit_url}

%elif thing.kind == Email.Kind.ACCEPT_PROMO or thing.kind == Email.Kind.EDITED_LIVE_PROMO:
%if thing.kind == Email.Kind.ACCEPT_PROMO:
This email confirms that your ad on ${site} has been approved. It will go live
on the dates you chose.

If you edit the ad's text, link or thumbnail after it's approved, it will have
to be approved again, so make any changes well before it starts.
%endif
%if thing.kind == Email.Kind.EDITED_LIVE_PROMO:
This email confirms that your edited ad needs to be approved again. Until it
is, the ad is paused and won't be shown.
%endif

    ${edit_url}

If you have any questions, just reply to this email.

%elif thing.kind == Email.Kind.REJECT_PROMO:
This email is to let you know that the ad you submitted to ${site} wasn't
approved. Any payment for campaigns that hadn't started yet has been refunded
(it can take a few days to reach you, depending on how you paid).

%if thing.body:
The reason given:
    ${thing.body}
%endif

If you have any questions, please reply to this email. To change your ad and
submit it again:
    ${edit_url}

%elif thing.kind == Email.Kind.QUEUED_PROMO:
This email is to let you know that your ad on ${site} is about to go live.

%if thing.trans_id > 0:
================================================================================
TRANSACTION #${thing.trans_id}
DATE: ${datetime.now(g.tz).strftime("%Y-%m-%d")}
................................................................................

AMOUNT PAID: ${thing.printable_total_budget}
AD: ${thing.link.make_permalink_slow(force_domain=True)}

================================================================================
%else:
Your campaign was free (${thing.printable_total_budget}).
%endif

%elif thing.kind == Email.Kind.LIVE_PROMO:
This email is to let you know that your ad on ${site} is now live. You can find
it here:

    ${thing.link.make_permalink_slow(force_domain = True)}

Thank you for advertising with us! You can follow its traffic here:

    ${promote.promo_traffic_url(thing.link)}

Traffic is counted with a delay, so at first you may not see any, and all
numbers are preliminary until 24 hours after the ad has ended. Sign in with the
account you bought the ad with to see them.

%elif thing.kind == Email.Kind.FINISHED_PROMO:
This email is to let you know that your ad on ${site} has finished. Its traffic
is here (the numbers are preliminary until 24 hours after the end):

    ${promote.promo_traffic_url(thing.link)}

Thanks for advertising with us! To run it again, visit this link and add a new
campaign:

    ${edit_url}

We'd love to hear how it went: just reply to this email.

%elif thing.kind == Email.Kind.REFUNDED_PROMO:
We're sorry, but we weren't able to show your ad as many times as you paid for.
You have been refunded the unspent part of your budget.

  ${edit_url}

If you have any questions, please reply to this email.

%elif thing.kind == Email.Kind.VOID_PAYMENT:
This email is to let you know that your payment of ${thing.printable_total_budget} for an ad on ${site} has been cancelled: you won't be charged, or if you already paid, the payment is being refunded (it can take a few days to reach you, depending on how you paid).

%if thing.reason == 'changed_budget':
This is because you changed the campaign's budget. Before the campaign can go live, please pay the new amount:

${promote.pay_url(thing.link, thing.campaign)}
%elif thing.reason == 'changed_payment':
This is because the campaign was paid for again in a different way.

You can edit your ad at the following link:

${edit_url}
%elif thing.reason == 'deleted_campaign':
This is because you deleted the campaign.

You can edit your ad at the following link:

${edit_url}
%elif thing.reason == 'rejected':
This is because the ad wasn't approved.

You can change your ad and submit it again here:

${edit_url}
%endif

%endif

Thank you,

The ${site} team
